# Auth module

## Concerns

- **session** — `AuthProviderPort`, Supabase Auth (cookies JWT), `getSession` / `signOut` via facade.
- **profiles** — tabela `profiles` vinculada a `auth.users` (role em `app_metadata`).

## Rules

- App code uses `@/modules/auth` facade/guards — not `@supabase/*` outside `infrastructure/` e `common/adapters/supabase/`.
- Login via `signInWithPassword` na Server Action; sessão enriquecida com perfil (`role`).
- Guards (`requireAuth`, `requireRole`) throw `AUTH_ERRORS` — no redirects in application layer.

## Client imports

Import `signInAction` from `presentation/actions/auth.actions.ts` and `SignInState` from `types.ts` — not the module barrel in Client Components.

Read: `src/modules/auth/README.md`.
